<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.memory.recalls ~ recall the nearest turns to a query

`lens` names the plane: content (the default), structure, form, persistence or crossplane. `imago` fetches one turn verbatim; `list` reports the taxonomy. `wing`, `agent` and `surface` narrow by provenance; `speaker`, `channel` and `function` surface one stratum of the block taxonomy; `pair` answers each block beside its turn's siblings. `sensorium` names the sensorium; absent, memory.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///sense.memory.recalls", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ query · k · wing · imago · list · agent · surface · speaker · channel · function · pair · lens · sensorium

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`query` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ the query`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`k` params=`takes/count ~ how many turns answer`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/word ~ the wing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`imago` params=`takes/word ~ fetch one turn verbatim`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`list` params=`~ report the taxonomy`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`agent` params=`takes/word ~ narrow by agent`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`surface` params=`takes/word ~ the transcript surface (claude, codex, copilot; all with bulk)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`speaker` params=`takes/word ~ one speaker stratum (operator, agent, harness)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`channel` params=`takes/word ~ one channel stratum (speech, thought, tool)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`function` params=`takes/word ~ one function stratum (steering, surface, ...)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pair` params=`~ answer each block beside its turn's siblings`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lens` params=`takes/word ~ the plane or instrument`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/word ~ the sensorium by name; absent, memory`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

